# Rituály listing

`/svatebni-ritualy` uses `Sections/ritualy.twig`. Deník has a journal layout; umění a gallery wall.

## Layout

- White page; each ritual sits on a greige band (`.75rem` white gap)
- Featured first entry larger; then alternating photo + copy chapters
- Photos reuse `.home-print` shadow + ≤0.5° tilt; native aspect ratio
- Year eyebrow, Fraunces title, summary, quiet “prohlédnout” cue
- Scroll reveal via `data-reveal` + `.is-in` (scoped with deník; respects reduced motion)
